    "body": "## Integration scope\n\nCombines the exact reviewed source heads from PRs #449, #450, #451, and #454 on one branch. The original PR branches and PRs remain unchanged and open.\n\n- Base: main@31b7a077820914e92de81239e5ab4099e3dfa558\n- #449: de6a6130622097d7123b3f4d6ce2da18bea1d9d3\n- #450: 6cb4c5886f49e94240ed0b4ba133c151bc205eae\n- #451: 8c42352136c8ded7d72cb87fac156f916e58cf1c\n- #454: a0c1fcd564498e12c204c68aed3420e3e701f445\n\nFour two-parent merge commits preserve each source PR HEAD as the second parent. The final reconciliation commit changes only the shared CI workflow and the two-person access specification.\n\n## Reconciliations\n\n- .github/workflows/chat03b2-private-api.yml now checks syntax for both clients and both harnesses, runs the 36 remote-client regressions and local two-player harness tests, retains offline D1 safety and local Worker/D1 integration. The unchanged chat03b1-gameplay-cas.yml remains in the tree and runs SQLite CAS, offline D1 safety, and local Wrangler/D1 checks.\n- gameplay-server/PRIVATE_ALPHA_TWO_PERSON_ACCESS_SPEC.md now records that the status-readback API exists in source and local Worker/D1 tests passed, while the API is not deployed and the real operator recovery procedure is not approved. Unknown hosted generation remains BLOCKED / STOP until verified hosted readback. Option A, per-device consent storage, isolated origins, and open PA gates are preserved.\n\n## Scope and checks\n\nNo production, Stage 7.15, Chat04/05, Cloudflare, hosted D1, deployment, credentials, or real-person invitation changes. No merge to main is authorized.\n\nExact-HEAD GitHub Actions checks are pending. The source PR checks passed on their respective heads; the aggregate branch must pass its own full checks and independent cumulative-diff review before this draft is considered ready.",
